# This repository is split into two independently deployable projects:
#   frontend/.env.example  -> Vite web app (frontend Vercel project)
#   backend/.env.example   -> Express API (backend Vercel project)
#
# Copy the relevant example into that project's .env.local for local development.
# The original combined root .env.local is still read by the backend for
# backward-compatible local development, but it is not used by Vercel.
